{"title":"住建部推行工程质量管理标准化","date":"2018-01-08","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;text-align:center;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-outline-level:1\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt\">住建部推行工程质量管理标准化</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;text-align:center;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-outline-level:1\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;text-align:center;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-outline-level:1\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; text-align: justify;\">住房城乡建设部日前发出通知，就开展工程质量管理标准化工作提出指导意见。旨在进一步规范工程参建各方主体的质量行为，加强全面质量管理，强化施工过程质量控制，保证工程实体质量，全面提升工程质量水平。</span></span></p>\r\n<section class=\"editor\" label=\"Powered by bj.96weixin.com\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 19px\">　　住建部明确此项工作的目标是，建立健全企业日常质量管理、施工项目质量管理、工程实体质量控制、工序质量过程控制等管理制度、工作标准和操作规程，建立工程质量管理长效机制，实现质量行为规范化和工程实体质量控制程序化，促进工程质量均衡发展，有效提高工程质量整体水平。<strong>力争到2020年底，全面推行工程质量管理标准化。</strong></span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 19px\">　　其主要内容为工程质量管理标准化，是依据有关法律法规和工程建设标准，从工程开工到竣工验收备案的全过程，对工程参建各方主体的质量行为和工程实体质量控制实行的规范化管理活动。其核心内容是质量行为标准化和工程实体质量控制标准化。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-top: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"float: left; font-size: 18px; height: 30px; padding: 0px 25px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(247, 121, 121); border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(247, 121, 121); border-left: 2px solid rgb(247, 121, 121); border-image: initial; line-height: 25px; border-right: none; color: rgb(247, 121, 121); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: 宋体;\">通知还明确五项重点任务</span></strong></span></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"float:left; margin-left:-13px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qlogo.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQXYS5iadtibZxdVKDHFVMT8UmPquGiatrgOl9KKBsX0OvAhedtqH1iaiaRKPibYiapdUenQtZTYb8quYeKA/0?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"display:block; width:32px;\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; clear:both;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding: 10px; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6iaLicKhavpXCJ8wOlcQQrv9np5vKz1BsFQib6paaxcrbtdccT9lPctyZg/0?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 100% 100%; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 5px; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254); overflow: hidden; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; height:40px; background-color:#f16c18; margin-top:20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-left: 10px; height: 40px; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6utqud6M3UbnElgsEbCP8zYowlg3OicwohL1iapulgFwoVOvLsmo1ictaw/0?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: 10px center; background-size: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-right: 10px; height: 40px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:center;height:40px; background-image:url(https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6utqud6M3UbnElgsEbCP8zYowlg3OicwohL1iapulgFwoVOvLsmo1ictaw/0?wx_fmt=png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:right center; background-size:10px auto; color:#fff; line-height:40px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 宋体;\">一是建立质量责任追溯制度</span></strong></span></strong></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding: 0px 15px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 宋体;\">明确各分部、分项工程及关键部位、关键环节的质量责任人，严格施工过程质量控制，加强施工记录和验收资料管理，建立施工过程质量责任标识制度，全面落实建设工程质量终身责任承诺和竣工后永久性标牌制度，保证工程质量的可追溯性。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding: 10px; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6iaLicKhavpXCJ8wOlcQQrv9np5vKz1BsFQib6paaxcrbtdccT9lPctyZg/0?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 100% 100%; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 5px; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254); overflow: hidden; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; height:40px; background-color:#f16c18; margin-top:20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-left: 10px; height: 40px; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6utqud6M3UbnElgsEbCP8zYowlg3OicwohL1iapulgFwoVOvLsmo1ictaw/0?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: 10px center; background-size: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-right: 10px; height: 40px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:center;height:40px; background-image:url(https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6utqud6M3UbnElgsEbCP8zYowlg3OicwohL1iapulgFwoVOvLsmo1ictaw/0?wx_fmt=png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:right center; background-size:10px auto; color:#fff; line-height:40px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 宋体;\">二是建立质量管理标准化岗位责任制度</span></strong></strong></span></strong></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-left: 15px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 宋体;\">将工程质量责任详细分解，落实到每一个质量管理、操作岗位，明确岗位职责，制定简洁、适用、易执行、通俗易懂的质量管理标准化岗位手册，指导工程质量管理和实施操作，提高工作效率，提升质量管理和操作水平。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding: 10px; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6iaLicKhavpXCJ8wOlcQQrv9np5vKz1BsFQib6paaxcrbtdccT9lPctyZg/0?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 100% 100%; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 5px; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254); overflow: hidden; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; height:40px; background-color:#f16c18; margin-top:20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-left: 10px; height: 40px; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6utqud6M3UbnElgsEbCP8zYowlg3OicwohL1iapulgFwoVOvLsmo1ictaw/0?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: 10px center; background-size: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-right: 10px; height: 40px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:center;height:40px; background-image:url(https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6utqud6M3UbnElgsEbCP8zYowlg3OicwohL1iapulgFwoVOvLsmo1ictaw/0?wx_fmt=png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:right center; background-size:10px auto; color:#fff; line-height:40px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 宋体;\">三是实施样板示范制度</span></strong></strong></span></strong></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-left: 15px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;font-family: 宋体\">在分项工程大面积施工前，以现场示范操作、视频影像、图片文字、实物展示、样板间等形式直观展示关键部位、关键工序的做法与要求，使施工人员掌握质量标准和具体工艺，并在施工过程中遵照实施。通过样板引路,将工程质量管理从事后验收提前到施工前的预控和施工过程的控制。按照&ldquo;标杆引路、以点带面、有序推进、确保实效&rdquo;的要求，积极培育质量管理标准化示范工程，发挥示范带动作用。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"editor\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding: 10px; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6iaLicKhavpXCJ8wOlcQQrv9np5vKz1BsFQib6paaxcrbtdccT9lPctyZg/0?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 100% 100%; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 5px; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254); overflow: hidden; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; height:40px; background-color:#f16c18; margin-top:20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-left: 10px; height: 40px; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6utqud6M3UbnElgsEbCP8zYowlg3OicwohL1iapulgFwoVOvLsmo1ictaw/0?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: 10px center; background-size: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-right: 10px; height: 40px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:center;height:40px; background-image:url(https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6utqud6M3UbnElgsEbCP8zYowlg3OicwohL1iapulgFwoVOvLsmo1ictaw/0?wx_fmt=png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:right center; background-size:10px auto; color:#fff; line-height:40px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 宋体;\">四是促进质量管理标准化与信息化融合</span></strong></strong></span></strong></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-left: 15px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;font-family: 宋体\">充分发挥信息化手段在工程质量管理标准化中的作用，大力推广建筑信息模型(BIM)、大数据、智能化、移动通讯、云计算、物联网等信息技术应用，推动各方主体、监管部门等协同管理和共享数据，打造基于信息化技术、覆盖施工全过程的质量管理标准化体系。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"editor \">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding: 10px; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6iaLicKhavpXCJ8wOlcQQrv9np5vKz1BsFQib6paaxcrbtdccT9lPctyZg/0?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 100% 100%; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 5px; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254); overflow: hidden; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; height:40px; background-color:#f16c18; margin-top:20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-left: 10px; height: 40px; background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6utqud6M3UbnElgsEbCP8zYowlg3OicwohL1iapulgFwoVOvLsmo1ictaw/0?wx_fmt=png&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: 10px center; background-size: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-right: 10px; height: 40px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:center;height:40px; background-image:url(https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fgnkxfGnnkQ3Mu2RFBEkK47J1CnDWHa6utqud6M3UbnElgsEbCP8zYowlg3OicwohL1iapulgFwoVOvLsmo1ictaw/0?wx_fmt=png); background-repeat:no-repeat; background-position:right center; background-size:10px auto; color:#fff; line-height:40px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 宋体;\">五是建立质量管理标准化评价体系</span></strong>​</span></strong></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-left: 15px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:32px\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 19px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\">及时总结具有推广价值的工作方案、管理制度、指导图册、实施细则和工作手册等质量管理标准化成果，建立基于质量行为标准化和工程实体质量控制标准化为核心内容的评价办法和评价标准，对工程质量管理标准化的实施情况及效果开展评价，评价结果作为企业评先、诚信评价和项目创优等重要参考依据。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>"}